[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 10682.55, "timestamp": "02:58:02", "text": "窗邊，而且，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10685.429, "timestamp": "02:58:05", "text": "餵食餵水也很重要。是啊，問題是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10688.389, "timestamp": "02:58:08", "text": "這隻貓走失了一段時間。那隻"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10691.269, "timestamp": "02:58:11", "text": "白貓還懷著孕。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10703.67, "timestamp": "02:58:23", "text": "呃，第五代套件即將推出。我認為這是第一代產品。這是這隻貓的第一代幼崽。白貓。呃，應該是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10709.67, "timestamp": "02:58:29", "text": "[音樂] 是啊"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10731.51, "timestamp": "02:58:51", "text": "。  所以，"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 10731.918, "timestamp": "02:58:51", "author": "@aniketwande4403", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_m_Z2M4vVHkWPdw0fzo-i-Dy4Pm4-b-bs22Utnn5zkWBHY=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "tomorrow stream or day off ?"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10735.03, "timestamp": "02:58:55", "text": "明天，嗯，明天"}]